Package: jSumTTest
Type: Package
Title: Independent Samples & One-Sample T-Test for Summary Data
Version: 2.0.0
Date: 2025-11-13
Author: Michael M. Malschützky
Maintainer: Michael M. Malschützky <michael.malschuetzky@h-brs.de>
Description: Calculate Student's and Welch's t-Test for independent samples as well as one-sample t-test (including related Cohen's d) based on summary data (mean, standard deviation, and sample size) for both samples resp. one sample and test-value, to comprehend reported tests.
License: GPL3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports: jmvcore (>= 0.8.5), R6, ggplot2, psych
